prompt:
Read /root/Desktop/video_schedule_audit/四月发稿排期.ics and /root/Desktop/video_schedule_audit/发稿制度规定.docx, and check the following three rules:
1. There must be a scheduled post between 18:00 and 20:00 on weekdays; any day without a scheduled post in this time slot counts as a violation;
2. The number of scheduled posts on each Saturday and Sunday must not be less than 3; any shortfall counts as a violation;
3. On the same day, the publishing interval between two adjacent videos must not be less than 2 hours; anything less counts as a violation.

Organize the violations into a Word document and save it to /root/Desktop/video_schedule_audit/排期违规自查报告.docx. The first paragraph at the top of the document uses the large heading “四月排期违规审查报告”, with the 黑体 font and the font size 三号 (16pt). Below the heading, use a three-column table to list all violations, with the headers “日期”, “违规事件名”, and “违规原因”. The text in the “违规原因” column should be red and bold.

